  <!-- EN: cute face -->
  <RK_Gene_CuteFace.label>可爱萌颜</RK_Gene_CuteFace.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have an adorable facial structure with rounded features, button nose, and expressive eyes that make them appear endearing and approachable. -->
  <RK_Gene_CuteFace.description>这种基因的携带者有着受人喜爱的萌系面容五官——圆润的轮廓、小巧的鼻子和灵动的眼睛，使他们看起来既可爱又亲切。</RK_Gene_CuteFace.description>
