  <!-- EN: fragile pain threshold -->
  <RK_Gene_FragilePain.label>易痛</RK_Gene_FragilePain.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have a lower pain shock threshold and go down more easily from injuries. -->
  <RK_Gene_FragilePain.description>这种基因的携带者疼痛休克阈值较低，受伤后比正常人更容易倒地。</RK_Gene_FragilePain.description>
  <!-- EN: fragile -->
  <RK_Gene_FragilePain.labelShortAdj>易痛</RK_Gene_FragilePain.labelShortAdj>
  
  <!-- EN: good gardening -->
  <RK_Gene_GoodGardening.label>园艺达人</RK_Gene_GoodGardening.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene work more efficiently with plants. -->
  <RK_Gene_GoodGardening.description>这种基因的携带者能更高效地完成种植工作。</RK_Gene_GoodGardening.description>
  <!-- EN: green thumb -->
  <RK_Gene_GoodGardening.labelShortAdj>园艺达人</RK_Gene_GoodGardening.labelShortAdj>
  
  <!-- EN: large round ears -->
  <RK_Gene_LargeEars.label>大圆鼠耳</RK_Gene_LargeEars.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have distinctively large, round ears that give them enhanced hearing and an unmistakably ratkin appearance. -->
  <RK_Gene_LargeEars.description>这种基因的携带者有着又大又圆的耳朵，赋予了他们更强的听觉能力。这是鼠族的典型特征之一。</RK_Gene_LargeEars.description>
