  <!-- EN: nimble -->
  <RK_Gene_Nimble.label>反应灵敏</RK_Gene_Nimble.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have heightened sensory receptor sensitivity, allowing them to better detect nearby threats and evade close-range attacks more effectively. -->
  <RK_Gene_Nimble.description>这种基因的携带者有着非常敏锐的感知能力，能更好地侦测周围威胁并提高近战闪避率。</RK_Gene_Nimble.description>
  <!-- EN: nimble -->
  <RK_Gene_Nimble.labelShortAdj>反应灵敏</RK_Gene_Nimble.labelShortAdj>
  
  <!-- EN: poor eyesight -->
  <RK_Gene_PoorEyesight.label>弱视</RK_Gene_PoorEyesight.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have difficulty with precision aiming, resulting in slower aim time and research speed. -->
  <RK_Gene_PoorEyesight.description>这种基因的携带者视力不佳，这会影响其射击精度、瞄准时间和研究速度。</RK_Gene_PoorEyesight.description>
  <!-- EN: poor eyesight -->
  <RK_Gene_PoorEyesight.labelShortAdj>弱视</RK_Gene_PoorEyesight.labelShortAdj>
  
  <!-- EN: small body -->
  <RK_Gene_SmallBody.label>娇小身躯</RK_Gene_SmallBody.label>
  <!-- EN: Small, compact body that dodges better but hits weaker and carries less. -->
  <RK_Gene_SmallBody.description>这种基因的携带者有着娇小紧凑的身躯，虽然非常灵巧，但近战命中率和携带能力较差。</RK_Gene_SmallBody.description>
  <!-- EN: small-bodied -->
  <RK_Gene_SmallBody.labelShortAdj>娇小身躯</RK_Gene_SmallBody.labelShortAdj>
  
  <!-- EN: thin tail -->
  <RK_Gene_ThinTail.label>细长尾巴</RK_Gene_ThinTail.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have a long, thin, hairless tail that helps with balance and is a signature feature of ratkin anatomy. -->
  <RK_Gene_ThinTail.description>这种基因的携带者长出了细长无毛的尾巴，有助于保持身体平衡性。这是鼠族的典型特征之一。</RK_Gene_ThinTail.description>
